 "captions": {
  "youtube_title": "Why You Still Remember That Embarrassing Moment 😳",
  "short": "That moment feels enormous to you. It was probably tiny to everyone else. 😳\n\nPsychologists call it the spotlight effect: in experiments, people overestimated how much others noticed them (Gilovich, Medvec & Savitsky, 2000).\n\nNext time it replays at 2 AM, ask: would I remember if someone else did that?\n\n💬 What's your most awkward \"you too\" moment?\n\n#lobelessons #psychology #overthinking #spotlighteffect #selfimprovement",
